      "parameters": {
        "content": "**UNVALIDATED_INSTALL — inactive template**\n\nGenerate private bindings to the existing credential names and exact account references before import. Default placeholder bindings block /start. The generated checks and HTTP credential selections must remain consistent. Select existing header credentials only: Anthropic x-api-key; Gemini x-goog-api-key; OpenAI Authorization (Bearer); runner local authorization header. Credential values never belong in this JSON. /start must succeed and return the authoritative task with matching account and credential references before any provider node executes. HTTP failures are recorded without retry. A timeout remains blocked for reconciliation; keep the watchdog independent.\n\nConfirm installed n8n version, runner reachability, existing credential/account mapping, and FREE_CREDITS_ONLY balances before activation. No paid fallback. No actual API or concurrency evidence is implied by this export.",
